WEBVTT

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.080
Well, looks like you're fucked!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.290
We finally caught you.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:23.910
And now you'll regret making
this harder than it had to be.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:25.910
Now suffer!

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.000
We're gonna be here all night!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Michel- <i>san</i> .

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:37.750
Thanks for the help, as always.

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:44.540
We all gotta help each other out
when we're in trouble.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.950
Now, time to hit the casinos...

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:54.290
We'll be looking forward to your next visit!

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:56.450
Thank you!

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:04.660
Oh, jeez.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:13.500
No...

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.950
It can't be!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:48.500
"Cabaret Club White Rose"

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.500
What? Again?

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.450
"White Rose Cabaret Girl"

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:51.450
Thank you, as always.

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:57.000
"Michel and the Stupid Book"

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:57.000
N-No, no. I'm just in a gifting mood.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:01.160
If you like Erica- <i>chan</i> that much,
ask for her to join you!

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:03.910
You get nervous when she
sits next to you, right?

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.290
You're so cute, Michel- <i>san</i> .

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.620
Aww, thanks...

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:11.330
Sorry!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:15.700
Oh, no! I'll go get a band-aid!

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:21.200
Is that Michel- <i>san</i> ?

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:23.160
"Hokkaido Fair"

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:26.950
Wow, somebody seriously ordered this.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.580
It tastes bland.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:42.910
Cause of death: electrocution.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.620
And every victim has a sweet smell
coming from their mouth.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:47.080
How strange.

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:49.160
Oh, old man. Another case?

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:55.910
"Genghis Khan Parfait"

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.620
Yeah.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:54.620
There's been a rash of deaths among

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.500
the local thug and pickpocket population lately...

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:57.500
Creepy.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.370
Here.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:03.950
Thank you.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.660
I'll take good care of Mr. Bear, okay?

00:04:06.660 --> 00:04:08.870
See you later!

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.910
O-Okay...

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:15.620
You're late, Erica!

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.790
Sorry, Takashi!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.580
It'd damn well better not happen again.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:20.950
Of course.

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:27.580
Michel- <i>san</i> , it's best not
to take it too seriously.

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:31.290
That's Erica- <i>chan</i> 's real boyfriend.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:32.200
Boyfriend!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.000
You're pretty average-looking,
so you don't make much money.

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.290
Sorry.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.580
I know what you need to do. Quit college.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.580
"Erica's BF"

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:44.580
And then you can use that
tuition money to buy me booze.

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.660
Erica- <i>san</i> , someone's asking for you.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.620
"West Side Capitalist"

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:00.540
Hey, I know him!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.250
He's a famous rich guy from the West Side!

00:05:06.580 --> 00:05:12.830
My grandma always told me to pay
respect to those that don't stand out.

00:05:12.830 --> 00:05:17.700
That's why I asked for you,
the most average-looking girl in this club!

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.330
Th-Thank you.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:24.330
I love my grandma, even though she passed away.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:28.950
So I always do the things she taught me to do.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:32.750
She gave me this ring, too!

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:37.040
It's the only one of its kind in the world!

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.620
Wow, that's amazing!

00:05:39.620 --> 00:05:43.620
I've been so bored on the West Side lately.

00:05:43.620 --> 00:05:45.120
Who's that guy?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.870
Harry Evans- <i>san</i> , a landowner from the West Side!

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:52.410
Everybody calls him Dopey
because he's like that.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.950
But this is Erica- <i>chan</i> 's chance
to get a rich customer.

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.870
Isn't this wonderful?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.660
I'm going home.

00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.620
What are you doing here?

00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:14.910
Michel- <i>san</i> , don't get so down!

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:17.830
There are lots of other
wonderful girls out there!

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:19.370
What are you talking about?

00:06:19.370 --> 00:06:20.870
It's okay!

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.950
It's fine! Let's go drink!

00:06:22.950 --> 00:06:27.700
What are you people even doing here?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:27.700
Come on, let's go have a nice chat.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.580
I'm... your friend.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.500
Michel! Look at this!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:45.660
Last night, Takashi Nakajo- <i>san</i>
from the Shinjuku East Side

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.250
was found dead in his room.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:52.830
"Suspect Erica 
Suzumoto"

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:52.830
His acquaintance, Erica Suzumoto,
was arrested for murder.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:53.950
What?

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:56.790
Isn't she your...

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:08.370
You know she's not a murder!

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:10.200
Sempai, calm down!

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:10.200
Like hell I'm going to calm down!

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.450
Give me all the info you've got!

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:17.620
I'm not on that case!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.700
And I can't let outsiders have access to it...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:22.410
"Outsiders"?

00:07:22.410 --> 00:07:26.870
That girl... Erica is my daughter!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:29.540
Now hand it over...

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:31.160
Hey.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:34.450
Tell me more.

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:48.830
I guess it would've been 15 years ago.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.830
I was a cop on the East Side.

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:55.250
Mommy! Let's go to the park!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:55.250
I was married back then.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:58.330
I had a five year old daughter.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:03.160
She was so cute.

00:08:03.160 --> 00:08:06.830
But I got into gambling.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:08.250
Bad luck, Michel- <i>san</i> .

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.910
Started trading insider info

00:08:10.910 --> 00:08:15.950
for relief from my debts.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:22.410
My ties to the Yakuza caught
the attention of some bad sorts...

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:25.450
They came after family one day.

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:27.500
You bastard!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.910
Erica!

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:39.870
Honey! Honey, Erica is... Erica is...

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.750
It's okay! It's okay!

00:08:45.660 --> 00:08:48.290
The cops fired me.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:52.500
And my wife took my daughter and left.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:58.540
I decided I'd never be a part of her life again.

00:09:04.950 --> 00:09:08.410
I don't have the right to be her dad.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:14.500
But I want to prove her innocence.

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:17.660
Show me the body of the dead man.

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:26.870
Poor Erica- <i>chan</i> ! She was so little,
but now she's grown up...

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.290
I'm taking an interest in the case, that's all.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:32.000
I'm not doing it to help you.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.750
Creepy.

00:09:33.750 --> 00:09:38.580
Understood! I'll do whatever it takes!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.700
The autopsy's not done yet,
so we don't know the details,

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:46.250
but we believe cause of death
to be a stab to the chest.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:51.000
The only fingerprints on the murder
weapon, a knife, were Erica- <i>chan</i> 's.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.500
What does she... what does Erica say?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:59.370
Um...

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:01.910
She came out of the bath
and found a bloody knife,

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:04.830
and picked it up without thinking about it.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:12.080
She stood frozen in the living
room until the cops arrived.

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.660
Could this be...

00:10:12.080 --> 00:10:13.660
The detective on the case

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:19.790
says that they likely got in a lover's
quarrel and she stabbed him.

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:19.790
No, that's not right.

00:10:19.790 --> 00:10:26.370
And the detective on the case is Onimaru- <i>san</i> .

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.200
Onimaru the Confessor?

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:30.200
Yes.

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:35.540
Whenever he goes after somebody,
they confess to things they didn't even do...

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:39.750
Damn it! Out of all the people...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:39.750
The killer is Dopey.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.870
Dopey? The guy from yesterday?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.370
But what?

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.910
First, look at this.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.370
Is that a hickey?

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.750
Guys' been having some fun, huh?

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.370
No, not at all.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:54.500
It's a stun gun mark.

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:59.450
He probably got whacked with it
before he got stopped.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.000
And then...

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.700
Wow, that's a weird place for those marks.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:06.370
This is...

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.790
"Carbon-Cut Star Ruby" "Pyrope Garnet"
"Gold (24k)"

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.790
...Dopey's Ring.

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:14.500
He grabbed onto it and got shocked.
That's where these marks came from.

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:23.540
Yeah, that ugly ring's the only
one of its type in the world!

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:26.370
Old man, that was pretty easy...

00:11:26.370 --> 00:11:29.580
Sadly, nope.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.910
He's a powerful man on the West Side.

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:34.620
The cops can't go after him easily.

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:38.750
So we'd have to steal the ring from Dopey?

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.660
That's right.

00:11:40.660 --> 00:11:43.700
And there's one thing I have to ask--

00:11:44.910 --> 00:11:45.750
Hey.

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:49.200
Sempai left already.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.830
That idiot!

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:04.950
Our next top story:

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:08.200
multiple violent felons escaped from

00:12:08.200 --> 00:12:12.120
Tokyo 7th Prison early yesterday morning.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:13.250
Oh?

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.000
Wait, that's where Moriarty is!

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:17.000
The police say that over 20 escaped...

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:18.700
I'm worried!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:21.500
The leader was bomber Albert Trevor,

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:25.000
Assistant, get off your ass.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:25.000
and several of his men...

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.620
"Beware of dog! (It bites!)"

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.620
They've probably got
a big doberman or something.

00:12:39.950 --> 00:12:42.580
But I can use this to distract it.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:54.080
Oh, my.

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:43.000
"Granny's Memory Museum"

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:48.250
This is the only place left.

00:13:58.750 --> 00:13:59.950
"Candies Granny Gave Me"

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:25.500
I don't have a choice!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.500
It's always the same.

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:40.080
I should've done this.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:42.700
I shouldn't have done that.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.500
I should've spent more time with her.

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.450
If I'd stayed by her side...

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:54.500
So this time, at least...

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.870
No, just this once!

00:14:57.870 --> 00:15:00.750
Just wait for me, Erica...

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:07.250
Crap!

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.950
What is this?

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:16.370
Stop right there!

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:20.830
Now you're a bad guy, too!

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:23.750
I saw you right when you came in!

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:27.700
I was just letting you go
so I could catch you in the act!

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.120
I'm so smart!

00:15:31.500 --> 00:15:34.750
You're the one who took out
that Takashi guy, right?

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:36.540
That's right!

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:40.000
The most important lesson Granny taught me

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.910
"Granny's Lessons"

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.910
is that bad guys need to be taught a lesson.

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:48.450
And so now you're going to be punished!

00:15:49.580 --> 00:15:55.700
When I left White Rose yesterday,
that man came to talk to me!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:59.040
Hey, you want a good time, right?

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.330
Come play with me.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.120
It's mine now!

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:12.700
He stole my ring from me by cheating at poker.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.580
So...

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:16.540
"Takashi's House"

00:16:24.580 --> 00:16:29.330
That ring is a treasure my grandmother gave me!

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.790
Oh, dear!

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:34.370
Sorry, I didn't realize.

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.080
Hey, what are you--

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:44.120
Punishment!

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.620
Complete!

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:51.120
Now, you snuck into my house to steal my ring.

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.450
You're a bad guy, too.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.950
I'll punish you!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:57.540
Okay, here we go!

00:16:57.540 --> 00:17:01.080
Watch me in heaven, Grandma.

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:04.330
I'm watching you right now, little Harry.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.910
Grandma?

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.200
"Dopey's Grandmother"

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.200
You're all grown up, huh?

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:12.660
I'm so proud!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:13.620
Grandma!

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:15.500
I thought you were dead!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.580
Hey, who are you--

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.910
Don't touch my grandma!

00:17:21.910 --> 00:17:24.540
It's okay now, Grandma.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.830
You came to see me, right?

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:31.950
I was worried you might
not be doing what I told you.

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.540
Hey, kiddo.

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:36.790
Why'd you punish that guy
in a different way, yesterday?

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.410
You're...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.700
I'm sorry.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:43.120
That's right. Actually...

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:47.330
Punishment complete!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.500
Huh?

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.580
What do I do?

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.790
I have to punish him...

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:56.500
I have to do what I was told, or Granny will...

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:07.160
Don't do that again, okay?

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.910
Got it? Good.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:12.500
You were a good boy and
learned your lesson, so take this.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:17.700
Whenever she was done scolding me,
Grandma always gave me candy.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:18.950
Now this time...

00:18:18.950 --> 00:18:22.580
Punishment! Complete!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:25.540
Takashi, you okay?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.830
Of course, I wanted to do it
with just the stun gun.

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:35.160
I knew it.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.040
By the way, kiddo.

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:43.000
Was it you who's been punishing the
pickpockets and other thugs in Kabukicho?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:47.500
They all had melted candy in their mouth.

00:18:47.500 --> 00:18:50.830
And they died of shock from a powerful stun gun.

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:54.040
Just like you punished Takashi.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:58.500
Of course, the ring he was
holding partially grounded him,

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.120
and kept it from being a lethal shock.

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.370
Yup! It was me!

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.450
They were all bad guys who came after my ring!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.330
So I punished them!

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:13.450
Sure, if you walk through
that town with a ring like that,

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.580
you'll attract attention.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.870
Attention's what I wanted!

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:20.620
I couldn't find any bad guys in the West Side!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:27.830
So you used the ring as bait
to find bad guys and then killed them!

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:29.580
I'm great, aren't I?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:32.040
Tell I'm the best, Grandma!

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:36.040
Of course. You really are my beloved grandson.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:41.660
Let me give your head a thwack-thwack.
I mean, a pat-pat.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:43.000
Come here.

00:19:43.000 --> 00:19:45.450
Yay! Pat-pat!

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:46.830
Grandma!

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:49.830
Okay! Pat-pat!

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:05.870
Punishment! Complete!

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:14.040
Hey! Untie me! Untie me!

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.500
Hello?

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:20.500
I didn't know you helped people like that.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:23.700
I'm glad I was able to help, too.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:27.000
No, it's pat-pat, not thwack-thwack!

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:29.200
Pat-pat the head!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:37.450
"Harry Evans Arrested For Murder"

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.000
And for our next stop story,

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.000
I just took an interest in the case,

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:31.790
that's all.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.250
Harry Evans was arrested

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.250
Right, right.

00:20:34.250 --> 00:20:37.450
as a suspect in a series of killings.

00:20:37.450 --> 00:20:43.500
I didn't do anything wrong!
I just did what Grandma told me!

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:49.410
He's a little weird, but they
say he was a good person.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:55.200
He was a philanthropist and he made
a lot of visits to people in prison.

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:57.200
And a guy like that...

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.200
You just never know with people.

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:04.330
Hey, are we sure about
leaving Michel- <i>san</i> like that?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:07.370
Erica- <i>san</i> doesn't know how hard

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:11.250
Mommy!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:11.250
her dad tried to save him, right?

00:21:23.540 --> 00:21:26.080
It's not up to us.

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:28.700
That's what he wants.

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:03.870
"10 Months Later"

00:22:59.910 --> 00:23:06.620
There's just two months left until
the Shinjuku ward mayor election!

00:23:06.620 --> 00:23:10.750
I'll continue to support
your way of life as best I can...

00:23:08.330 --> 00:23:10.750
"Sebastian Moran"

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:15.330
"Mach Kuniyoshi"

00:23:10.750 --> 00:23:13.450
I'm Mach Kuniyoshi, and I'm running for mayor!

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:20.250
Crimes by the escapees from Tokyo
7th Prison are growing by the day!

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:20.250
"Ward Mayor Candidate"

00:23:20.250 --> 00:23:23.700
We need a new plan! A new leader!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.830
"Serial Killer Commits Suicide In Prison"

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.830
There's a new mess going on outside every day.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.080
It's almost election time.

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:37.790
Moran's still pissing me off like always.

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:40.000
Sorry.

00:23:40.000 --> 00:23:42.660
We're not open yet.

00:23:42.660 --> 00:23:44.700
How awful.

00:23:44.700 --> 00:23:47.700
Have you forgotten me?

00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:49.540
Hey, you can't just--

00:23:53.330 --> 00:23:57.080
My name's James Moriarty.

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.250
I'm back, everyone!

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:04.870
"Looking back on Saudade"

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:04.870
Home Run! Congratulations!

00:24:04.870 --> 00:24:06.830
